\begin{solution}{exo:b2:potential-wells-tunneling:8}
(a) 见\cref{thm:b2:potential-wells-tunneling:tunnel}。(b) $\kappa a = 3$：
精确值 $1/(1 + \sinh^23) = 9.9 \times 10^{-3}$，近似值 $4\eu^{-6} = 9.9 \times
